    "updated_at": "2021-03-10T02:48:26Z",
    "body": "It would be great to have a unified link attribute processing model, and perhaps then certain types could opt out of the effects of certain attributes. Like, what happens to a link@rel=icon with an `integrity` attribute? Similarly with a manifest... I don't think any use agent does an integrity check on either (should they?).  ",
